        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 232, Embellished Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFit for royalty, this Omnia made door knob features luxurious detailing. This Embellished Knobset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes a richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. Easy to install, the 232 Omnia Embellished Knobs will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Embellished Door Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 232 Embellished Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-ring-brass.jpg?v=1704354519\" width=\"227\" height=\"120\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
