                "description": "Fit for royalty, this Omnia made door knob features luxurious detailing. This Embellished Knobset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes a richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. Easy to install, the 232 Omnia Embellished Knobs will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
